// Template for local signing configuration.
//
// XcodeGen wires this file into the Alfa target (see project.yml -> configFiles),
// so signing settings survive project regeneration and never enter the repo.
//
// Setup:
//   1. cp Config/Local.xcconfig.example Config/Local.xcconfig
//   2. Set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM below to your Apple Developer Team ID.
//      Find it with:
//        security find-certificate -c "Apple Development: <your-apple-id>" -p \
//          | openssl x509 -noout -subject
//      The Team ID is the OU= field. A free personal team is sufficient for
//      personal sideloading (7-day provisioning, no paid membership required).
//   3. Regenerate the project: nix run nixpkgs#xcodegen

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
